        {
          "_key": "915293b396a1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "What Is MD115 All About?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ad346d42e100",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "693e91cfed3c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "MD115 is part of Australia’s “managed growth” strategy for international education."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6ce39bfae10f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8188e4b94b56",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Basically, each university and college in Australia will now have a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "e878642bdc02",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "set number of new international students"
        },
        {
          "_key": "cbb101c91b8f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " they can take every year."
        },
        {
          "_key": "275e29f3a6e7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "\n"
        },
        {
          "_key": "3384d98b7ae0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "This number is called their "
        },
        {
          "_key": "77ce384c4cf3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "New Overseas Student Commencement (NOSC)"
        },
        {
          "_key": "bdd4bd010ba2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "97c3e9f22922",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "6cc1ce7e0b17",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "How quickly your visa gets processed depends on how full your chosen institution already is."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0406b87f2358",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5ab3b203655b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "How Visa Processing Times Will Change"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c503c0801d23",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ec66e8e9c609",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Australia is introducing three "
        },
        {
          "_key": "eae0e2d5e4f8",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "priority levels"
        },
        {
          "_key": "713d77c9e093",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " for visa processing:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f67609cd851b",
      "_type": "rawHtml",
      "html": "<table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><thead><tr><th><strong>Priority Level</strong></th><th><strong>University Capacity Used</strong></th><th><strong>Visa Processing Time</strong></th><th><strong>Status</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Priority 1</strong></td><td>Under 80%</td><td><strong>1–4 weeks</strong></td><td>Fastest</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Priority 2</strong></td><td>80–115%</td><td><strong>5–8 weeks</strong></td><td>Normal</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Priority 3</strong></td><td>Over 115%</td><td><strong>8–12+ weeks</strong></td><td>Slowest</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "_key": "20524be40036",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c369a1087cb2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "💡 "
        },
